# SFT Dataset Audit

## Gate

**PASS.** The frozen SFT-P0 expert dataset satisfies the pre-training audit gate.

## Source and reconstruction

Rows come only from successful hand-coded ALFWorld experts on the `train` split.
Before every expert action, the collector obtained the environment-owned action
list, assigned deterministic `A000...` IDs, required one exact command match,
rendered the public SFT-P0 prompt, and executed the unchanged expert command.
The prompt contains the goal, current public observation, the last four public
action/result transitions, and the complete current indexed action map. Expert
plans and TextWorld facts are never prompt inputs.

The expert may exploit planning behavior stronger than public observation alone
supports. This dataset is therefore supervised expert-policy imitation and a
competence bootstrap, not autonomous self-improvement.

